e. Every player of a club moves by one whole number and its best few by one more, held to 1–99 and never past a teammate rated above him, whichever brings the club nearest its target: −4 to +3 points this season. The results count twice, by design: the credit's points for and against place a club's players at their positions and weigh its offence against its defence, and the move then sets the club's level from its margins, wherever the credit left it. Facts from Pro Football Archives; the weights tuned once on 2001–2005 against the next season's Madden launch ratings, then frozen."},"map":"nfl1966","clubs":[{"id":"nfl-green-bay-packers","name":"Green Bay Packers","code":"GBP","league":"NFL","country":"840","col":"oklch(0.72 0.16 198)","str":83,"squad":[["Bart Starr","QB",92],["Zeke Bratkowski","QB",65],["Jim Taylor","RB",85],["Elijah Pitts","RB",82],["Carroll Dale","WR",86],["Boyd Dowler","WR",77],["Max McGee","WR",66],["Bob Long","WR",64],["Marv Fleming","TE",79],["Bill Anderson","TE",58],["Bill Curry","OL",88],["Bob Skoronski","OL",88],["Forrest Gregg","OL",88],["Jerry Kramer","OL",88],["Fred Thurston","OL",71],["Gale Gillingham","OL",61],["Steve Wright","OL",57],["Ron Kostelnik","DL",90],["Willie Davis","DL",90],["Lionel Aldridge","DL",86],["Henry Jordan","DL",82],["Bob Brown","DL",61],["Jim Weatherwax","DL",60],["Dave Robinson","LB",99],["Lee Roy Caffey","LB",95],["Ray Nitschke","LB",83],["Tommy Crutcher","LB",61],["Bob Jeter","CB",92],["Herb Adderley","CB",83],["Doug Hart","CB",67],["Tom Brown","S",84],["Willie Wood","S",75],["Dave Hathcock","S",58],["Don Chandler","K",58]]},{"id":"nfl-dallas-cowboys","name":"Dallas Cowboys","code":"DAL","league":"NFL","country":"840","col":"oklch(0.72 0.16 44)","str":82.5,"squad":[["Don Meredith","QB",97],["Craig Morton","QB",60],["Dan Reeves","RB",92],["Don Perkins","RB",84],["Bob Hayes","WR",92],["Pete Gent","WR",76],["Frank Clarke","WR",72],["Buddy Dial","WR",71],["Pettis Norman","TE",72],["Dave Manders","OL",96],["Ralph N